[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0010","text":"爱依酱的指甲，好有趣呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0020","text":"很厉害吧！美甲艺术\n朝日酱也要试试～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0030","text":"嗯——\n朝日明天有拍摄呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0040","text":"诶——\n好想做点什么啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0004","text":"反正马上\n卸掉就行了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0005","text":"那，\n只做护理之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_00_0006","text":"或者弄个\n发型什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_01_0010","text":"好！\n给我画个超厉害的吧！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_01_0020","text":"超厉害的！？\n……能行吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_02_0010","text":"哦，那个好！\n朝日酱，过来这边～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_02_0020","text":"……？\n指甲我有好好剪的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_03_0010","text":"那个也不错！\n怎么样？朝日酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05030000_03_0020","text":"可以是可以……\n但一被摸头发就会犯困"}]
